<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KAMI MARINE - Maritime Credentialing System</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1e293b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 32px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #475569;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: #facc15;
            color: #0f172a;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #eab308;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: #cbd5e1;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 96px 0;
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 450px;
            gap: 64px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-text .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background-color: #fef9c3;
            color: #854d0e;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 56px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .hero-text h1 span {
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        /* Login Card */
        .auth-card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .auth-card h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .form-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #1e293b;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .form-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #facc15;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.1);
        }

        .auth-footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .auth-footer a {
            color: #0f172a;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .auth-footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Welcome Card (for logged in users) */
        .welcome-card {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .welcome-avatar {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background-color: #facc15;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .welcome-card h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .welcome-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .welcome-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features {
            padding: 96px 0;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .features-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
        }

        .features-header h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            background-color: #fef9c3;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #854d0e;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* CTA Section */
        .cta {
            padding: 96px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta-card {
            background-color: #fef9c3;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 80px 40px;
        }

        .cta-card h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .cta-card p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #854d0e;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 32px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 48px;
            }

            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav-links {
                gap: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <nav class="nav">
                <a href="/" class="logo">KAMI MARINE</a>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <% if (user) { %>
                        <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                        <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline">Logout</a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/admin/login" class="btn btn-outline">Admin Login</a>
                        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">Sign In</a>
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Registry</a>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <div class="hero-text">
                        <div class="badge">Maritime Credentialing System</div>
                        <h1>The definitive ledger for <span>professional seafarers.</span></h1>
                        <p>A disciplined framework for managing maritime certifications, vessel experience, and career progression with the precision of a bridge logbook.</p>
                        <div class="hero-buttons">
                            <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Join the Registry</a>
                            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline">Learn More</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="auth-card">
                        <% if (user) { %>
                            <div class="welcome-card">
                                <div class="welcome-avatar">
                                    <%= user.FNAME.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + user.LNAME.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
                                </div>
                                <h2>Welcome back!</h2>
                                <p><%= user.FNAME %> <%= user.LNAME %></p>
                                <div class="welcome-actions">
                                    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">View Dashboard</a>
                                    <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;">Logout</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div class="auth-header">
                                <h2>Crew portal</h2>
                                <h3 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;">Sign in to your record</h3>
                            </div>
                            <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Sign In</a>
                            <div class="auth-footer">
                                New seafarer? <a href="/register">Register here</a><br>
                                <a href="/admin/login" style="font-size: 13px;">Admin login</a>
                            </div>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="features" id="features">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="features-header">
                    <h2>What every record contains</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="features-grid">
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">ID</div>
                        <h3>Identity & Documents</h3>
                        <p>Passport, CDC, Seaman's Book, place of issue, expiry watch.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">CO</div>
                        <h3>Competency & Rank</h3>
                        <p>Certificate of Competency, grade, vessel preference, days at sea.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">VE</div>
                        <h3>Vessel Experience</h3>
                        <p>Sign-on / sign-off log per vessel, flag, type, tonnage, and rank held.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">CE</div>
                        <h3>Certificates</h3>
                        <p>STCW, GMDSS, AFF, medical — issuing authority and expiry tracking.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">MN</div>
                        <h3>Medical & NOK</h3>
                        <p>Medical certificate, blood group, next of kin contact and address.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">AD</div>
                        <h3>Admin Oversight</h3>
                        <p>Crew roster with status, full record drill-down for management.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="cta">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="cta-card">
                    <h2>One record. Maintained by you, trusted by the bridge.</h2>
                    <p>Create your seafarer profile, keep certificates current, and let principals access a single, verified source of truth.</p>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Create my profile</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>© 2025 KAMI MARINE. Professional crew placement and technical management for the global commercial fleet.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
